$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM 7-Amino-6-nitro-1-phenyl-4-(phenylsulfonyl)-1H-indazole (5). Potassium
tert-butoxide (2.24 g, 20 mmol) was added to a solution of sulfone 4
(3.79 g, 10 mmol) and TMHI (4.0 g, 20 mmol) in DMSO (70 mL). The reaction
mixture was stirred at room temperature for 30 min, poured into water,
and acidified. The precipitate that formed was filtered off, washed with
water, and dried in air. Compound 7 was obtained. Yield 3.84 g (97%).
M.p. 280-285 °C. Found (%): C, 57.57; H, 3.88; N, 14.33. C19H14N4O4S.
Calculated (%): C, 57.86; H, 3.58; N, 14.21. 1H NMR, δ: 7.21 (s, 2 H,
NH2); 7.64-7.72 (m, 8 H, Ph, PhSO2); 8.12 (d, 2 H, Ph, 3J = 7.4 Hz); 8.52
(c 1 H, CH); 8.54 (s, 1 H, CH). 13C NMR, δ: 117.38, 118.62, 121.75,
122.51, 123.44, 126.12, 127.63, 128.39, 129.73, 129.83, 130.00, 133.44,
133.55, 137.67, 138.28, 140.79. IR, ν/cm-1: 3440, 3328, 1616, 1572, 1520,
1496, 1460, 1448, 1404, 1380, 1324, 1300, 1264, 1204, 1156, 1084, 1072,
936, 876, 772, 744, 720, 696, 688. MS, m/z: 394 [M]+.
