$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Synthesis of compounds 3a,b (general procedure). Bis(pyridine) silver
permanganate AgPy2MnO4 (1.15 g, 3 mmol) was added portionwise to a
solution of compound 1 or 2 (2 mmol) in a saturated solution of NH3 in
MeOH (15 mL) at -10 °C. The reaction mixture was kept for 0.5-4 h (TLC
monitoring), poured into water, and acidified with HCl to рH 4. Then the
mixture was extracted with ethyl acetate (3×50 mL) and dried with Na2SO4.
The solvent was evaporated and the residue was chromatographed on a
column (SiO2/CHCl3). 7-Amino-4,6-dinitrobenzo[d]isoxazole-3-carbonitrile
(3a). The yield was 0.46 g (92%). M.p. 239-242 °C. Found (%): C, 38.34;
H, 1.40; N, 27.52. C8H3N5O5. Calculated (%): C, 38.57; H, 1.21; N, 28.11.
1H NMR, δ: 8.90 (s, 1 H, H(5)), 9.43 (s, 2 H, NH2). IR, ν/cm-1: 3452
(NH2) 3324 (NH2), 1536 (NO2), 1328 (NO2). MS, m/z: 249 [M]+.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM chemoselective, regioselective
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Synthesis and oxidative cyclization of
7-amino-3-R-4,6-dinitrobenzo[d]isoxazoles
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
